1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,242
Watch the force from the spring, the pink arrow.

2
00:00:03,242 --> 00:00:05,924
Stretch the spring and it pulls back.

3
00:00:05,924 --> 00:00:08,190
Squash it and it pushes back.

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:13,502
The further you go, the harder it pushes, and it always points towards the middle.

